        // An arithmetic summary may combine the final consecutive tickets
        // into one operand, e.g. “116+30+30+40=216” for five tickets where
        // the last two胆拖 tickets total40. Allocate one operand per ticket
        // until the final operand, then distribute that remainder across all
        // remaining ticket blocks proportionally.
        if (count($operands) < count($ticketRows)) {
